# Document

"document.tip.winCond.pelican.devour.title" : "Devour Trigger"
"document.tip.winCond.pelican.devour" : "The Pelican wins when all players except the Pelican are be devoured or only the Pelican is alive."
"document.tip.winCond.pelican.timeOver.title" : "Time Over"
"document.tip.winCond.pelican.timeOver" : "When Pelican Time is over, the alive Pelicans will win."

"role.pelican.doc" : "A neutral who wins by devouring enemies."
"role.pelican.winCond" : "Win when all players except the Pelican are be devoured or only the Pelican is alive.%WIN%"
"role.pelican.winCond.pelicanTimeOver" : "<br>Moreover, <var>when Pelican Time is over, the alive Pelicans will win too.</var>。"
"role.pelican.ability.title" : "Inherent Ability [Bottomless Appetite]"
"role.pelican.ability.main" : "Can devour a player whole. Devoured players do not die and will be digested when the meeting starts without dead bodies. %PELICANTIME%"
"role.pelican.ability.devour" : "<title>Devour</title>Devour the player. The devoured players' cam target will be locked at the Pelican."
"role.pelican.ability.pelicanTime" : "<br>When only <var>%NUM%</var> players alive, It is going to start <b>"Pelican Time"</b>.<br>During the Time, anyone cannot report, use the vent or sabotage. <br>It lasts <var>%DURATION%</var>s."
"role.pelican.tips" : "・The devour distance is <b>1.25x</b> that the vanilla kill distance.<br>・The role is created by <b>DHMO</b>."

